ve |f_n(t)|≤C_n for t∈[0,1].\",\n      \"assessment\": \"Valid individual boundedness result; it does not establish the exposition’s uniform-bound claim.\",\n      \"evidence\": \"Since n≥1 and 0≤t≤1, |nt|=nt≤n.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"omissions\": \"The rendered formal argument does not claim or prove a bound independent of n.\",\n  \"toolsUsed\": \"Read /input/INPUT.md with a shell cat command; used direct mathematical reasoning. No external references or Lean checks.\",\n  \"checkingStatus\": \"Audited the supplied exposition and rendered formal argument only. No original Lean module was provided or checked.\"\n}"}}
